<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">Edolo [ETR]</book>
  <para style="rem">Domasia siiba dëdëi</para>
  <para style="rem">5 Nofember 2016gi Ginidoea Filimono hamogisa maadei.</para>
  <para style="rem">23 May 2018 JG started advisor check at ms heading. Finished verses and intro 31 May 2018.</para>
  <para style="rem">Finished Team Check 19 Jun 2018</para>
  <para style="rem">JG starts and finishes back translation 30 Mar 2019</para>
  <para style="rem">Start and finish Consultant Check with John Bruner 13 Apr 2022. Jan Gossner and Duluba Ibo present as translators and Heose Galima and Fumada Nagumu as UNSs.</para>
  <para style="h">Filimono</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flmn</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filimono</para>
  <para style="toc1">Foloea Filimonoma, Beba Dëdëla Ïasi</para>
  <para style="mt">Foloea Filimonoma, Beba Dëdëla Ïasi</para>
  <para style="imt">Ado Dëdëi Dibe Amoïe Neala Olelo Oboba</para>
  <para style="ip">Filimono eda dolö edefade afädë nelo. Eda gaamu Golosi ami fii Geleso sosogo nefolalo amogi afädëda e nelo. Dolö afädë, ïe galabaia hamoi gadoi hamolasilo, ïe ëida Onesimusi nelo. Eada, ïe beaha aligilo neebe amo dïgïla awäla, gaamu elögi namolö asi. Gaamugi ami nea, Onesimusi ea Folo galabaia neebe amobalä damelë hamola neada, Onesimusi e Gelesoma asigi afädë negei.</para>
  <para style="ip">Segeyo amo gala Folo e galabaia negei nelo ameada, e Filimono neebea moholö ulï nelo. Amai gabugi, Onesimusi e ïe beaha aligilo neebea obëgëmäia, Foloea beba gowe dëdëlahilä, Onesimusima ï. Foloea Filimonoma gomalä säla beba dëdëla ïasi. Ïe galabaia hamoi gadoi hamolasilo amoma habobala made, eda walio Geleso sosogo ameada, Filimono eda ïe edoo gadoi hamola, e neawela helegela namolöla sämalola säla dëdëla ïasi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="ms">Filimonoïe galabaia hamoi gadoi hamolasilo nelo bahïla asi amo, hobeala bu oböla Geleso sosogo nebegi, Foloea e Filimono neebea bu obëgëmalola säi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Neda Folo. Neda Geleso Yesuïe galabaia dolömelë. Nilïle nedoo Dimodi alïa nilïle damelë nilïbalä hamoi gaalu hamosa aligilo Filimono dima beba gowe dëdëla ïasisago. <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />Amase, alïa nilïle nalifi Abia dimage, nihïlïgïla nudusa aligilo Agibasa dimage, Geleso sosogo Filimono dia mosöa gedosa aligilo amolimage, beba gowe dëdëla ïasisago.<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Nilïle Naado Godeage, Dafidilo Geloi Yesu Gelesoeage, dilima ugila negelasilole, neala dalulasilole, ïmäia hamesa neawe.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filimonoïe mala hedabia Folo neala obeägïlasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4-5" />Dia Dafidilo Geloi Yesuma asigi bogia adogola nea, Godeïe udia dolö sulubadela boba hamosa neala säi nabi amolegi, na nïe Godema adosaleada, di helësëla Godema nesegesamu aligilomelë. <verse eid="PHM 1:4-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Dida nilïbalä nea, nilïa Gelesoma asigi afädë negei amoïege, asigi afädë negei amomadila Godeïe dawa hedabi dima bäumäiage, nilïa nelebo hedabi Gelesomadila nii amoli sulubadela dia hedabola helësëmäiage, na Godema adolasisa aligilomelë. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Ae, nedoo. Dïe boba hamolo dibe goeada, Godeïe udia dolö sulubadelaïe iso asigi gelolasilomelë. Amala hamolo ameada, nïe iso asigige neala obeägïlasila gelolasimelë.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filimonoea Onesimusi ïe edoofalï gadoi hamola neawela namialola säi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Dia hamomäia na hamese amoda, Gelesoïe ëigi nea, dofea dia hamomola dofä ulufala sämolöi neawe. Gasoda, dia mala hedabi hamolo amoli na dawa ameada, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />na dima gelola sämolö made helësëi. Boba hamolo mala dibe ameada, na dima geleä säha. Neda Folo, ado mala gaula aulo momaeai, Geleso Yesuïe galabaia dolö nea sähago. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Na dima, nïe malö Onesimusima mala hedabi hamomolölela nabaha. Onesimusi e ne galabaia neebea ami maasebegi, ea Gelesoma asigi afädë negemäia, na ema säla oleleimelë. Ne galabaia nea, neda ïe eedo gadoi hamola nelo.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Onesimusi eda Filimonoïe galabaia hamoi gadoi hamolasilo nelo. Hobeala, e fisäla awäla Folo neebea besela galai. Amalahilä, Folobalä neada, e Gelesoma asigi afädë negei. Segeyo amo gaalu ilile malaeada, hamoi hamolasilo fisäla awäseda, beaha aligiloea ami dolöma nufudala baagomäiala säla ïmolöi dialeala säla negei dilo.</char></note> <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Dafidida, ea di fidila negemolöi made nelo gasoda, oböla walioda, ea alï halïgïla ugila negemolöi nea.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Onesimusi, Giligi adoeada, hamoi hedabi hamolola sälo amo gadoi.</char></note><verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Na hä, e walio di neebea obëgëmalahago. E maasebegoda, dofä nïe bobafalï fisiga gahagomelë. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Ado Mala Hedabi olelelo amoïe galabaia neebea ami neëgi, dia ne ugila negelo amo gadola, Onesimusia hamomäia e halïgïla neala sämolö helësëi. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Gaso, dia dofeala made säseda, nada e made gauia idogomolö. Dia hamomolö amoda, na dima gomalä hamomalola made sämolö. Be, dia hamese amo gadola hamomäiamelë. Dia nema hamoi hedabi hamomolö helësëseda, dihï hamese amo gadola hamomalo.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Na helësësaleada, ea di dïgïla salele ede made aliga gala nelo ameada, e obëgëla maala, hä, dibalä namolöi namolöla helësësamelë. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />E obëgëla maala dibalä namolö amoda, e galabaia hamoi gadoimu hamolasilo neala helësëmabio. Dofä, eda dïe hamoi hamolasilo gaso, walio amo baagila awäla, eda didoo obeägïfalï namolömelë. Na e dofä boba hamolo gaso, dia ema obeägïmolö amoda, ea galabaia hamoi gadoi hamolasise amogimu made, Gelesomadila e didoofalï neebela beala, na e boba hamolo neebe amo baagila awäla, dia e dofä boba hamomolömelë.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Dia alï dila neala helësëseda, ne maasegi obeägïla gauia idogolo amo gadola, Onesimusi emage amo gadola wäla hamomalo. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Amase, ea dibalä asiala hamoi galëge, bidi negei galëge, nema negesimalo. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Neda Folo, nihïle naaboea ado we dëdësamelë. Bidi goda na ïdulä. Dïe namolö nebalä bidi negei dialeala sämolöi gasoda, na ado go sämolö habosebe.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ado Age Golïdi 16.21gi dibe amo bimalo.</char></note> <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Nedoo, dia nabualo. Dafidilo Geloiïe ëigi nea, dia mala hedabi na säse amo gadola hamomäia hamesa. Alï Yesu Gelesoïe neebe ameada, dia mala hamosebe amea, nïe iso asigi neala obeägïlasimäia hamesamelë.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Na dima beba dëdëla ïasisegoda, dia hamomolöla helësësa. Na helësësaleada, dia hamomolö ameada, na dima nabasewe baagila moholöla helësësamelë. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Amase elöda, dilia adoi amo Godea nabala, ne dili neebea fisiga gamolö gabula helësësamelë. Ameada, ne maala midilöïe dia mosö hogoli afädë daiala negesimalo.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folobalä hamoi gaalu hamolo nefolalo amolia Filimono hawioi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Ebafolasa eege, Geleso Yesuïe hamoi hamosa nebegi galabaia negei nebalä neebeweage, di hawiosebego. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Dolö odoa nebalä hamoi gaalu hamosa aligilo Magaeage, Alisadagusaeage, Demasaeage, Ulugueage, ilia di hawiosebego. <verse eid="PHM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Dafidilo Geloi Yesu Gelesoïe ugila negelasilo dilile gesamibalä diamiäiamelë.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:25">Hä amo.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>